<div class="topic-sheet">
  <h1>Inference - How to answer</h1>
  <section class="summary-block summary-blue">
    <h2>How to answer</h2>
    <p>Be a detective. Look for clues in actions, words or descriptions.</p>
    <p>Always answer with evidence from the text.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="summary-block summary-green">
    <h2>If you are stuck</h2>
    <p>Use this frame: “I think [idea] because the text says [quote].”</p>
  </section>
  <section class="summary-block summary-pink">
    <h2>Where the clues hide</h2>
    <p>Actions: “He shuffled his feet and looked away.” He feels nervous.</p>
    <p>Dialogue: “I suppose… if I must,” she said reluctantly. She does not want to.</p>
    <p>Description: “Dark clouds gathered and the wind howled.” Something bad is coming.</p>
  </section>
</div>
